        "chapter": "Biotechnology: Principles and Processes",
        "solution": "<p>The restriction enzymes and their specific recognition and cleavage sequences are:</p> <p>(i) <i>AluI</i> recognises and cleaves the blunt-end sequence 5′−↓−3′ (a).</p> <p>(ii) <i>BamHI</i> recognises and cleaves the sequence 5′−↓−3′ (d).</p> <p>(iii) <i>EcoRI</i> recognises and cleaves the sequence 5′−↓−3′ (c).</p> <p>(iv) <i>HindII</i> recognises and cleaves the blunt-end sequence 5′−↓−3′ (b).</p> <p>Therefore, the correct match is i-a, ii-d, iii-c, iv-b.</p> <p>Hence, the correct option is (A).</p>"
