        "chapter": "Biotechnology: Principles and Processes",
        "solution": "<p>The steps of recombinant DNA technology are isolation of the genetic material, amplification of the gene of interest by PCR, insertion of the recombinant DNA into the host, obtaining the foreign gene product and finally downstream processing.</p> <p>Therefore the order is (i) → (iv) → (ii) → (iii) → (v).</p> <p>Hence, the correct option is (B).</p>"
